      "text": "The 1872 California Powder Works Bridge in Paradise Park is one of the best‑preserved wooden Smith truss covered bridges in the nation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
